Package: whatsapp-webview
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: sandikodev <androxoss@hotmail.com>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Recommends: libnotify4
Description: Lightweight WhatsApp Desktop Webview
 Cross-platform WhatsApp Web desktop wrapper built with Go.
 Uses system WebView (WebKitGTK on Linux) for a lightweight,
 native-feeling WhatsApp experience without Electron.
 .
 Features:
  - Native WebView window
  - Persistent WhatsApp session
  - Dark mode support
  - Native notifications
  - Single instance protection
